-Patch Notes:
    - Boss fight added
    - Player can now remap controls
    - New maps (level4, level_final)
- Bugfixes:
    - Fixed gamebreaking typo in boss map

v0.0.5
---------------------------------
-Patch Notes:
    - Gamepad support officially added
    - New sound fx added
    - Dash sound fx fixed (it is much less annoying now)
    - Map adjustments
    - Enemy death animations
    - Minor screenshake effect added for visual feedback
- Bugfixes:
    - Hp bar was erroneously displaying 120/100
    - Player footsteps effect trailed on even when player was not walking

v0.0.4 
---------------------------------
